tools.description:
Answer multiple independent typed questions (noul/yes-no, choice, score) over one shared state (and optional images) in a single pass, returning calibrated probabilities and confidence for every question.

questions: object mapping question ids to definitions:
  {"type": "noul", "instructions": "Is this urgent?"}
  {"type": "choice", "instructions": "Which team?", "criteria": {"billing": "charges/refunds", "tech": "bugs"}}
  {"type": "score", "instructions": "Severity?", "criteria": ["low", "medium", "high"]} (lowest first)
Supports multi-backend routing (api_only, local_only, api_with_local_fallback) across Magpie gateway, local OpenDecider, TypeSafe Jev, Perplexity, Google & OpenAI.
